{
  "id": "29873_saikousei",
  "headword": "再構成",
  "reading": "さいこうせい",
  "romaji": "saikousei",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "reconstruction; restructuring; reorganization",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "reconstruction; restructuring; reorganization",
      "explanation": "The act of putting something together again in a new arrangement, or reorganizing a system, structure, or set of information. Often used with する."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29873_saikousei_ex1",
      "japanese": "データを{再構成|さいこうせい}する。",
      "english": "To reconstruct the data.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29873_saikousei_ex2",
      "japanese": "{組織|そしき}の{再構成|さいこうせい}が{進|すす}む。",
      "english": "The reorganization of the organization is moving forward.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29873_saikousei_ex3",
      "japanese": "{事件|じけん}の{経緯|けいい}を{証言|しょうげん}から{再構成|さいこうせい}した。",
      "english": "We reconstructed the sequence of events from the testimony.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Composed of {再|さい} (re-, again) + {構成|こうせい} (composition, structure). Takes する to become a verb ({再構成|さいこうせい}する). Applies to physical structures, organizations, data, and mentally piecing together events.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {組織|そしき}を{再構成|さいこうせい}する: to restructure an organization\n- {記憶|きおく}を{再構成|さいこうせい}する: to piece memories back together\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {再編|さいへん}: reorganization — often of organizations or systems on a large scale\n- {再建|さいけん}: rebuilding — restoring something that has collapsed or failed",
